    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the zombie factory! We're glad you're able to assist with our endeavors to build an evil, zombified army for world conquest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is simple: You must sort human body parts into bins for use in repairing zombies. Make sure you sort the parts into the correct bins! You don't want a zombie with a foot for a head, or a liver where the heart is supposed to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you advance in level, the speed of the conveyor belt increases, and new parts are thrown into the mix. Good luck!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the zombie factory! We're glad you're able to assist with our endeavors to build an evil, zombified army for world conquest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is simple: You must sort human body parts into bins for use in repairing zombies. Make sure you sort the parts into the correct bins! You don't want a zombie with a foot for a head, or a liver where the heart is supposed to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you advance in level, the speed of the conveyor belt increases, and new parts are thrown into the mix. Good luck!</p>",
    "short_description": "A simple puzzle platformer for creating and repairing the undead. Sort body parts on a conveyor belt and combine them into zombified creations for world conquest. Make sure you sort the parts into the correct bins!",
